<!--
    XML VALIDATION

    There are two important terms:

    1. Well-formed XML
       - Follows all XML syntax rules.

    2. Valid XML
       - Is well-formed.
       - Also follows rules defined by a DTD or XML Schema (XSD).

    Important:
    Every valid XML document is well-formed.
    But every well-formed XML document is not necessarily valid.
-->

